<section class="hero" id="top">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">Systems engineering · Web platforms · Infrastructure</p>
<h1>Chuck Guifarro Lagos</h1>
<p class="hero-role">Systems &amp; Web Engineer<br/><span>Technical Coordinator</span></p>
<p class="hero-lead">I build, deploy, maintain, and improve web platforms—and the infrastructure that keeps
