<section class="section" id="about">
<div class="container split-heading">
<div>
<p class="section-index">01 / About</p>
<h2>An engineer across the full platform lifecycle.</h2>
</div>
<div class="prose">
<p>I’m a Systems Engineer with 4+ years of professional experience building and maintaining web platforms,
            administering Linux-based infrastructure, and troubleshooting production systems.</p>
<p>My work combines hands-on delivery with technical coordination: collaborating with clients and
