<div class="container">
<div class="section-heading">
<p class="section-index">02 / Expertise</p>
<h2>One profile, four connected capabilities.</h2>
<p>Practical experience spanning delivery, operations, coordination, and support.</p>
</div>
<div class="expertise-grid">
<article class="expertise-card"><span class="card-number">01</span>
<h3>Web Development</h3>
<p>Complete Drupal and WordPress websites, static sites, API integrations, and production-ready front ends.
            </p>
<ul class="tag-list">
<li>Drupal</li>
<li>WordPress</li>
<li>PHP</li>
<li>JavaScript</li>
<li>Astro</li>
<li>REST APIs</li>
<li>SQL</li>
</ul>
<p class="detail">Advanced practical WordPress experience without claiming custom plugin or theme
              specialization. Growing professional and independent experience with Astro.</p>
</article>
<article class="expertise-card"><span class="card-number">02</span>
<h3>Systems &amp; Infrastructure</h3>
