<ul class="clean-list">
<li>Assign tasks and review deliverables</li>
<li>Participate in technical decisions</li>
<li>Clarify client requirements</li>
<li>Estimate timelines and coordinate delivery</li>
<li>Support the team’s technical approach</li>
</ul>
